WEBVTT

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.200
<i>Summer Vacation.</i>

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:13.940
<i>Even here in the prestigious cooking
school Totsuki, students get to enjoy it.</i>

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:21.240
<i>Within its walls, some chefs were chosen for the annual Autumn Election.</i>

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:25.760
<i>Even now they continue to experiment with their dishes for that event.</i>

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.800
Oh, Lady Erina.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:33.250
How goes your cooking Hisako?

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:36.560
Thanks a lot for letting me use your kitchen.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:42.580
It's no problem, an Election organizer must
do well in the upcoming Autumn Election.

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.800
Of course! I'll do everything I can!

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.830
This complex and favorable aroma...

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:52.350
Yeah, I'm experimenting with various spices.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.800
I see, looks like it's coming along nicely.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:01.320
<b>Sniffing Noises</b>

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.500
Why not try this recipe, for reference!?

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.000
Y-Yes, I will, thanks.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.700
Now then, could I sample your dish now?

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.800
H-uh!?!?!?

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:19.800
I would be honored to hear your thoughts
and it would definitely ease my doubts...

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:21.300
But even so,

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.300
I... want to succeed with my own skill!

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:30.300
As I thought, anyone with a heart
half as pure as your own would agree.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:32.420
Go and give it your best shot!

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:37.300
Oh..? Ryou-kun...

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:38.040
Yeah...?

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:43.840
<i>What else can I do now...</i>

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:48.080
<i>Everything for the Election is already done.</i>

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:50.500
<i>Should I head to Karuizawa resort?</i>

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.300
<i>No, going by myself if would be weird.</i>

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:56.300
<i>Should I be trying new dishes?</i>

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:04.000
<i>In moments like this, what do <i>normal</i> girls do to pass the time?</i>

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:07.980
Lady Erina, you have a call!

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:10.070
It's from Lady Alice.

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:47.000
<b>Meanwhile, at the
 Polar Star Dorm</b>

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:59.360
Next up... I just keep mixing until it gets smooth.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.300
This will preserve the flavor.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.300
Me-Megumi! You know there's no pot there?!

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:11.450
I've reached my limit... Even my tongue's
going to burn from the spices at this point...

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:15.300
I agree, not to mention the summer kitchen heat.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.280
Let's take a breather outside.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.900
That's it! I know what we can do!!

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.900
What is this place?

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:29.460
Don't you know?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.220
Its a public swimming pool.

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:35.200
Anyone could tell that by looking!
I'm asking why you broug--

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:37.370
Why are you still wearing your uniform, Erina?

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:39.720
That's because you told me to "hurry"!

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:43.650
Good afternoon, we're going to a pool.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.500
If you want to come, hurry up!

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:49.520
I <i>thought</i> it would be a Nakiri family private pool!

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:50.790
Listen Erina!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.800
We are both "out of touch" with "ordinary" things.

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:55.500
We need this experience to become better cooks who have "common sense".

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:58.940
We need this to become great chefs. 
Even you <i>should</i> see that.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:02.310
Then, why come to this place in particular?!

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:04.560
Geez, all you can do is just complain.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:07.430
And I even invited you because I knew you were free.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.650
That was just today!

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:13.400
I'm usually always busy tasting new dishes and other matters!

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:15.470
I'm heading back.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:16.780
As I thought.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:22.150
Well, this would be too much for someone forever ignorant of "ordinary" matters like yourself Erina.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.500
WHAT!?

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:26.140
I'll go! All I have to do is go right?!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:31.090
You and Miss Erina sure are good friends, huh?

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:33.300
How? We get along like cats and dogs, you know.

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:34.300
Really..?

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:40.800
Let's fill the pool up to the top and
enjoy ourselves like we're on vocation!

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.790
I wonder about that...

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:48.300
But... we can't slack off right before the Election comes, heheheh...

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:50.930
Megumi... there's no pot there either.

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.300
Let's drop the spatula for now.

00:05:55.510 --> 00:06:00.580
See, even Megumi has had too much.
Lets relax before the Elections.

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:05.800
That said, lets get into our swimsuits and recover some energy before the Election!!

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:10.000
That swimsuit sure is cute!

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:13.050
Erina...

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.020
I'll lend you this.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:16.700
What is this...?

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:25.330
You're clueless Erina... With that garment, you can cover your body while you change.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:29.800
Like this?

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:32.820
Erina, you look so stupid in that..

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.220
What's wrong with you!?

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:39.960
No more...

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.840
It's so hot...

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.870
The pool isn't done filling yet!?

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.800
The pool water looks so refreshing.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.300
Megumi! Those are bushes!

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:58.270
It's finally done! Look at how great our pool is!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:01.800
And so...

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:04.300
...and then she was actually a dude!

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:05.980
There's no way, don't be stupi--

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:17.150
There's so many people here.

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:23.150
Okay, go setup the umbrella at our
headquarters for the day over there!

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:24.300
Yeah... yeah... I see it...

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:29.140
Erina, how long are you going to keep your jacket on? You can't swim with it.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:31.100
I kn-know that!

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:48.660
I've only been to private beaches before, so it's weird to wear swimsuit around so many people...

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:52.120
Let's enjoy the pool, Erina..!

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.800
W-Wait, hold on!!

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:13.300
<b>Guarding the 
bags and chairs</b>

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:18.300
So cramped...

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:20.380
The water was cool only for a second...

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:25.300
T-This wasn't how I thought it would be like at all...

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:27.800
Of course it ended up like this...

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.470
WHAT-DID-YOU-SAY!?

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.750
It's cause your're breasts are taking up all the room!!

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.010
Please, don't splash!

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:37.340
You want it cool?!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:40.360
I'll give you cooooooooool!!

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:45.480
With this hose, we'll surely get refreshed!

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:53.660
Eh!? The water evaporated in a instant...
That's unexpected...

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.800
You used way too much pressure!

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.720
I couldn't make it better at all...

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.550
At least she realized now the future refuses to change...

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:05.040
I'm such a moron!
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.880
But... I do feel refreshed.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:11.970
Ryoko-chan! Yuki-chan!

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:15.070
Thank you!

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:20.800
Looks like tomorrow onward I'll be able to do my best!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.070
It's an angel! There's an angel among us!

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.200
Thank you!

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.610
Megumi! Don't leave!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:30.970
Whoa it's hot over here!

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:32.540
Hey, it's Yukihira.

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.120
What's Isshiki-senpai doing here?

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:40.970
I was cooped up in my room, so I decided to go somewhere refreshing.

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:43.170
So I decided to garden!

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.880
I don't feel better at all!

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:49.200
That's not surprising at all...

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:55.100
Even so, Isshiki-senpai said he'd take me somewhere actually refreshing.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.870
There's somewhere refreshing?

00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:03.200
Yes! It's nearby wand I was thinking of inviting everyone. Want to come along?

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:04.800
Let's go now!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.060
Eh? Megumi?!

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:08.200
Don't go toward the light!

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:13.760
Not again Jun... She forget to water.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:21.800
Why did air conditioner have to break today...

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:25.840
I should just buy another one...

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:30.670
But the only money I have is for the club budget...!

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.430
So... Nikumi!

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:40.190
Stop calling me Nikumi..!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:45.430
Ah yes, by the way, isn't it too hot?

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:51.540
I mean... isn't that clothing... you know... inappropriate?

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:56.530
Stop saying stupid things! Don't you feel hot in all that shit!!!

00:10:56.570 --> 00:11:00.330
D-Dumbass! True men can deal with summer heat no problem!

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:01.230
Like I give a damn!

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.140
Hey, what's up!

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.800
Yukihira! It's been so long!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.500
It sure is hot! Ain't it Konishi-san?

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.250
Why are you here all of a sudden?

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.750
I told you I'd come whenever I felt like it.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:16.620
Oh yeah...!

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:23.440
Ummm... I'm making something new for the menu... want to taste it...?

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:25.070
Nah. Too hot for that.

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:28.870
That aside, want to go out together?

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:31.170
<i>"Together"?!</i>

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:33.790
<i>You mean...? Just the two of us?!</i>

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:39.900
Honestly I'm really busy with club stuff, but if you came just to get me I could...

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:44.440
I'm actually going with everyone at the dorm.
Just thought it'd be funner with more people.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:47.020
<i>Everyone...!?</i>

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.800
Don't worry about the club just go Nikumi.

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:50.920
No thanks....

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:54.450
No need to worry about me, Nikumi!

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:56.990
WHO ON EARTH WOULD EVER WORRY ABOUT YOU!?

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:01.940
I told you I won't go so I won't, 'cause this isn't the time to fool around!

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:05.490
That so? Well, see you next time then.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:10.660
Mito-san isn't coming?

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:14.100
Yeah, she looked like she was in the middle of making a next dish.

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:15.280
Really...

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:17.160
Guess this is everyone then?

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:19.880
Alright, let's go!

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:21.600
Yeah!!

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:34.880
The cool water feels great!

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:39.040
Oh, there's something I forgot to mention.

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:43.040
It's common for men to try "hitting on you" at pools to get your phone number.

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:45.670
I wouldn't just give it away!

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:51.190
Go be a man and talk to them!
They're both super hot!

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:54.300
Don't be stupid...! There's no way they'd give me a chance!

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:55.740
Also...

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.600
Anyway, doesn't seems like it's that common.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:11.020
I guess the men today are just too shy.

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:14.200
Feels like I wouldn't make it back if I tried...

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:18.000
Hey, Ryo-kun. Go buy us some ice cream.

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:19.650
Kay..

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.530
It's beautiful!

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:24.690
Now this is refreshing!

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:26.740
It's... Huge!!!

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:30.980
So cold!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:35.120
What is this place? Are we even still on campus!?

00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:40.180
Our school is really big. Isshiki-senpai did say you should explore?

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:42.620
The wind feels great!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.580
Feels relaxing, right Isami?

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.400
Can say that again, Nii-chan!

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:48.390
When did you...!?

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.410
Same time you did!

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:54.890
We were going for a walk when Tadokoro invited us.

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:57.530
<i>Alright, let's go!</i>

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:59.160
<i>Yeah!!!</i>

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:01.400
Remember now?

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.700
We're right there!!

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:04.500
Whoops, didn't notice.

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:08.940
Listen Yukihira! I am your Rival!!!

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:13.390
No matter the time or place, that will <i>NEVER</i> change!!!!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:14.770
Huh...

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:17.060
Feels great!

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:20.220
Nii-chan, that was lame!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:23.130
Hey, where did Isshiki-senpai go?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:24.520
Well, he...

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:32.100
Kept you waiting, huh? Let's enjoy this together!

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:34.100
Huh, he's not wearing his loin cloth?

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:36.550
Yet he feels more exposed than usual...

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:38.900
Great, it's ice!

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:40.700
What're we doing with the ice?

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:43.270
Obviously, we'll use the ice for... this!

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.570
Here you go.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:47.240
Thanks, Ryo-kun!

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:52.400
People say this ice cream is delicious. Why not try some, Erina?

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:55.520
Thanks Kurokiba-kun.

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:56.610
Kay...

00:14:56.690 --> 00:14:59.030
I'll buy some drinks now.

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:01.400
Ooh, I sure can depend on you, Ryo-kun!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:08.660
The flavor is sharp and sweet, and it has a satisfying softness when it meets your lips.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:10.500
I suppose it's not bad.

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:13.720
This is "ordinary" people food,

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:15.430
don't let it corrupt your refined palette, Erina.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:19.140
I won't! So stop assuming the worst for me!

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:20.620
Oh, it's melting!

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:30.710
Let's get ready to start the shaved ice eating contest! First to finish wins!

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:35.320
The winner will earn the title of "King of Shaved Ice"!

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:38.640
This pressure... This large serving...

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:41.590
Don't go and hurt yourself now, Takumi.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:45.030
Shut up, Yukihira!! I won't let a challenge against you slip away!

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:46.340
Begin!

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:56.440
My head is going to freez--!

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:57.300
Oh, it's fine...

00:15:58.530 --> 00:16:01.110
You won't get brain freeze if you eat it fast!

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:03.750
You're right... is this ice special?

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:08.640
If you take ice cubes and shaves them finely, the texture will still be good,

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:13.130
but small pieces will reduce the cold you feel.

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:15.030
That's right!

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:17.470
So that's why there's no brain freeze!

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:19.090
I get it now...

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.690
This strawberry flavor is exceptional!

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:28.290
The strawberry's came from the orchard and Fumio-san prepared them, right?

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:30.280
The peach one is really good too!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.660
The mango one is the most marvelous!!!

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:43.180
Anyway, I'm not interested in such shallow relationship. Boys aren't worth my time.

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:48.660
Ooh? Erina, you haven't had a crush or a single boy confess to you?

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:50.000
You're such a kid!

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:53.840
E-Even I have someone I admire.

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:57.050
"Even I have someone I admire"

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:59.710
Why do yo have a recorder?!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:02.140
Felt like a nice chance to record a weak point.

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.810
Put that away!!!

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:06.940
Okay, okay... so? Who is he?

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:10.840
Does thinking about him make your heart pound?

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:12.520
W-well... yeah.

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:17.640
His unmatched knife skills and perfect use of seasoning...

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:23.170
His cooking was really close to what ideal cooking should be.

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:27.730
Just thinking about him makes my heart pound!

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:31.140
He embodies the kind of cook I want to become!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:34.540
Well... did you two ever try to go out on a date or anything?

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:37.760
Date...? Why would I do something like that?

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:41.970
Geez? You don't know the first thing about love!

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.500
You're a lost cause, Erina!

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:46.990
What about you Alice!? You're only acting more experienced, right!?

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:52.280
I'm well informed. I've already studies all the subtleties of love!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:53.740
Se-Seriously?!

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:58.400
<i>She's just seen lots of romance movies...</i>

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.970
<i>...and she always falls asleep halfway through.</i>

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:06.240
Stop spitting ice over here!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.510
You're one to be talking!

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.980
You ready to fight!?

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:11.170
Ready when you are!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.430
Oh, got a text from Fumio-san.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:16.240
Same here.

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:20.510
What's the matter Yukihira!? Can't keep up the pace?!

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:22.900
Oh! Yoo! Nikumi!

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:24.540
Y-Yeah...

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:27.010
Oh, Mito-san! You came!

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:27.980
Well, yeah...

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:30.320
Konishi-san texted her directions

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:34.960
Don't worry about me and go Nikumi... Nikumi... Nikumi...

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:37.540
Go ahead and get a snow cone, Nikumi.

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:39.690
I-I don't wanna...

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.510
You "don't wanna"? Are you sure?!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:46.510
Do you really not want this huge and refreshing snow cone?!

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:50.810
I...

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:54.040
won't eat it unless it has condensed milk!

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:02.330
Hope you enjoy it!

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:14.130
Really... they don't even have hair driers!? I can't believe this place.

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:16.140
This outing was terrible.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:18.340
You think so? I enjoyed it!

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:22.900
I mean, I got to see you see look foolish in towel.

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:25.760
You didn't invite me just so you could see that!?

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:29.730
<i>Like usual, I have no idea what Alice is thinking...</i>

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:31.860
It's me.

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:34.740
Yes, bring the car.

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:36.780
Come on! Please wait...

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:38.190
I won't leave you!

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:46.690
... How pointless.

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.330
What's so fun about that?

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:56.340
Victory......!

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.980
You okay Nii-chan? Need some hot chocolate?

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:04.000
That Yukihira! He just walked away and left me behind...!

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:06.120
So? So?1 It's delicious, right?

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.400
I'm stuffed!

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:09.640
It was delicious!

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:11.790
It was really good!

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:12.980
It was, huh.

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:21.180
Hey! We're just getting started! Next up we barbecue!

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:23.750
Fumio-san, you're the best!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.960
Then, leave it to me!

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:27.460
Wait Yukihira, I'll--!!!

00:20:27.480 --> 00:20:29.330
Leave the meat to me!

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:38.410
I can't handle the  heat anymore...

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:45.120
This is kneer... a special kind of cold soup.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:49.510
When it's hot out like during Summer, it tastes very good.

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:51.930
If you eat it, You'll get your energy back!

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:54.300
Thanks so much, Hayama-kun!

00:20:56.170 --> 00:21:00.100
<i>It's so light and cooling! ...such heavenly flavor!</i>

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:05.590
I added some cardamom to give it a light base and other spices to add flavor.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:10.310
As expected of Hayama-kun! It's delicious! It relieved my heat fatigue!

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:16.080
Alright! The meat is perfect right now!

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:17.150
Alright!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.490
It took a while!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:26.410
Victory...

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:29.110
Lady Alice took you to a public pool!?

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:33.210
Are you fine!? People didn't do anything to you right!? Did anyone try to molest you!?

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:35.240
I'm completely alright!

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:39.730
Let's rest for tonight, we have a lot to do tomorrow.

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:43.420
Yeah, you have to go to Shirogane's restaurant for a tasting,

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:47.100
and you have to attend another opening ceremony.

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:48.240
That's fine.

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:52.200
But, Lady Erina... Isn't this too much work?

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:54.780
I would suggest try postponing one.

00:21:55.180 --> 00:21:59.010
No, it's no problem for me at all. I can do it.

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:08.360
Tamaya!!!

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:10.720
So beautiful!

00:22:10.750 --> 00:22:12.290
This spot is perfect!

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:26.380
<i>I can't think of anything other than cooking right now.</i>

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:29.100
<i>Not until I'm the best!</i>

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:37.200
<i>Erina Nakiri, 16 years old. Born into the prestigious Nakiri household,</i>

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:39.490
<i>a long line of master chefs.</i>

00:22:40.650 --> 00:22:44.190
<i>From a young age, she has displayed an exquisite palette.</i>

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:47.820
<i>With that, she has carved her own future.</i>

00:22:48.310 --> 00:22:51.210
<i>However, despite having "God's Tongue",</i>

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:55.960
<i>she has yet to know what flavor love is.</i>

00:22:56.540 --> 00:22:59.240
Alright then, let us begin!

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:33.600
<i>Alice Nakiri, 16 years old.</i>

00:24:34.530 --> 00:24:39.520
<i>Born into the prestigious Nakiri household, along line of master chefs.</i>

00:24:40.550 --> 00:24:47.110
<i>She is an authority on molecular gastronomy, a field where an error is unacceptable.</i>

00:24:49.230 --> 00:24:55.110
<i>Yet, the flavor of love... is still unknown to her!</i>

00:24:56.400 --> 00:25:00.500
Heh, heh, heh, heh, SUMMER IS THE BEST!
